  "body": "When using the docs/spec to build out a client, I ran into an issue when trying to auth using email from id server. \r\n\r\nAccording to docs, the auth looks like this:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/blob/ad5d46d3317bd3d016ed7bf1e3fb5ce1f8d7fef1/specification/client_server_api.rst#L797\r\n\r\nBut according to synapse, it should be named this:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/54283f3ed49ce40059e9f0746f2ded08ce3a5b9e/synapse/handlers/auth.py#L454\r\n\r\nSo the two differences are the key name and whether it should contain an object or array.",
